<%- include('partials/game_head', {tab:'admin'}) %><main><section class="gs-panel"><span class="gs-tag">CONTROL ROOM</span><h1>ADMIN GAME STORE</h1><p>Atur identitas store, kontak penengah, dan kategori game.</p><form action="/admin/game-store/settings" method="post" class="gs-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= gameCsrf %>"><label>Nama aplikasi (mengubah nama Averpay di seluruh aplikasi)<input name="name" required maxlength="60" value="<%= settings.name %>"></label><label>Nomor / URL admin penengah<input name="mediator" maxlength="500" value="<%= cfg.mediator %>" placeholder="628123456789 / https://t.me/admin / https://..."></label><small>Tombol “MC ADMIN JIKA RAGU” muncul di seluruh halaman store.</small><button class="gs-btn yellow">Simpan pengaturan</button></form></section><section class="gs-panel"><h2>TAMBAH KATEGORI GAME</h2><p>Foto menggunakan konfigurasi GitHub yang sama dengan Avergram. <a href="/admin/social">Atur penyimpanan Avergram ↗</a></p><form action="/admin/game-store/categories?csrf=<%= gameCsrf %>" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="gs-form" data-upload-form><label>Nama game *<input name="name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Free Fire"></label><label>Deskripsi *<textarea name="description" required maxlength="1000" rows="3"></textarea></label><label>Foto kategori *<input name="photos" type="file" required accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" data-photo-input data-min="1" data-max="1"></label><small>JPG, PNG, WebP; maksimal 5 MB.</small><div class="gs-preview" data-preview></div><p data-form-error class="danger" role="alert"></p><button class="gs-btn yellow">Tambah game +</button></form></section><section class="gs-section"><h2>KATEGORI TERSEDIA</h2><div class="gs-grid"><% categories.forEach(c=>{ %><article class="gs-card"><img class="gs-admin-cover" src="<%= c.image %>" alt="<%= c.name %>"><div class="gs-card-body"><h3><%= c.name %></h3><p><%= c.description %></p><form action="/admin/game-store/categories/<%= c._id %>/delete" method="post" data-confirm="Hapus kategori ini?"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= gameCsrf %>"><button class="gs-link danger">Hapus kategori kosong</button></form></div></article><% }) %></div></section></main></div><script src="/game-store.js" defer></script></body></html>
